nSo an alarm cancelled with 0 ms of CPU time is common on this Worker. By itself it does not explain the stall (inference).\n\nPlease cover two more points in the ea2bfc00 report:\n1. A row stopped with reason limit never archives again. Name the paths that store a stop with reason limit, and say whether one of them is reachable in a migration pass.\n2. Say whether the recovery in 891e8254 brings Room A back. If it does not bring back a row stopped on limit, say what does.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}